error[LM-F010]: `\q` is not an escape the format knows
 --> t.langmeld:4:13
  |
4 | rule File = "a\q" E
  |             ^^^^^
  = note: To fix this, use `\"`, `\\`, `\n`, `\r` or `\t`, or write the character itself.

error[LM-F011]: `0` is not a precedence
 --> t.langmeld:6:19
  |
6 |  infix M "+" prec 0 left }
  |                   ^
  = note: To fix this, write a whole number from 1 to 65535; a larger one binds tighter.
